    "html": "<p>An object with a mass of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2\"></span> kg has a weight of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"40\"></span> N on the surface of planet X. The mass of planet X is ten times the mass of Earth. What is the ratio <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{radius  of  planet  X}{radius  of  Earth}\"></span>?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{5}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"5\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{5}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
